@startuml
title US-07 Activity: Record Return Evidence

start
:Open Borrowed transaction;
if (User is participant?) then (No)
  :Deny access (403 Forbidden);
elseif (Return image & note provided?) then (No)
  :Show validation error (400);
else (Yes)
  :Store return photo;
  :Save Proof (RETURN) & Transaction -> COMPLETED;
  :Update Item -> AVAILABLE;
endif
stop
@enduml
